        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List companies the current user can act on",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/accessible/me/",
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns the set of companies the authenticated user can target in API calls.\n\n- Staff users: marker response indicating \"all\" — no list is returned.\n- Merchant of Record users: their managed companies plus their own.\n- Brand (buyer) and Supplier users: their own company only.\n\nUsed by the MCP `list_accessible_companies` tool. Also useful for any client\nthat needs to render a company-picker scoped to the user's permissions."
        },
