              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Acknowledge the current marketplace T&C version for the brand company.\n\nAcknowledgement mechanics (version stamping, audit row, idempotency,\nbackfilled-row upgrade) live in\n``apps.companies.services.marketplace_terms`` — shared with\n``CompanyInfoViewSet.finish_onboarding``."
        },
